It is built with inua's toolkit and copies parts of inua
(https://github.com/lyricat/inua), which is under the Apache License 2.0:

  - assets/themes/*.css: the built-in colour themes (inua's ui/themes/)
  - the scaleText function (inua's internal/shell/textscale.go)
  - the field texture drawing (inua's internal/shell/wallpaper.go)
  - the cairo binding (inua's internal/gamesui/cairo.go), which draws the
    isekai composition

The isekai theme's composition (decor.go, assets/themes/isekai.css) is
fimars's own drawing in the ISEKAI JŌCHO concept, used with permission;
it is not from inua. It is a fan tribute to the virtual singer ヰ世界情緒
(Isekaijoucho) of KAMITSUBAKI STUDIO: no official artwork is included,
and joucho is not affiliated with the artist or the studio. The credit
on screen says so.
